    <subfield code="a">Four teenage boys, Terry, Clayton, Dan and Stevie look for the girl of their dreams. Passing themselves off as film producers they begin a search for sexy actresses to be in a screen test for a non-existent movie. One of their actresses, Theresa, is the daughter of an underworld boss and he wants the film. With only a week to produce a real movie or wind up in a cement mixer, the boys come up with a radical solution to their problem.</subfield>
